"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> (node)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> (height ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t=\\{u\\in T:\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land u\\neq t\\}\">\\(P_t=\\{u\\in T:\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land u\\neq t\\}\\)</span> (strict predecessor set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> (tree order)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10HeightOfNode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10HeightOfNode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,R)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>，第三参数为严格良序关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}node}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree10HeightOfNode}_S(h,T,\\leq_T,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\land\\exists P_t\\;\\Bigl(P_t=\\{u\\in T:\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land u\\neq t\\}\\land \\mathrm{OrderType}_S(h,P_t,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_t\\times P_t:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}node}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree10HeightOfNode}_S(h,T,\\leq_T,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\land\\exists P_t\\;\\Bigl(P_t=\\{u\\in T:\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\land u\\neq t\\}\\land \\mathrm{OrderType}_S(h,P_t,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_t\\times P_t:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary node-height definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"